<p>a) Prior periods reclassified to conform to current presentation.</p>
<p>Note: Year-ago quarter includes pre-tax charge of $1.6 billion for the restructuring and cost-reduction effort at NCR.</p>
<p>AT&amp;T is required to reformat its results reporting to reflect the spinoff of Lucent Technologies, the sale of AT&amp;T Capital Corp., and the expected spinoff of NCR.  In addition, AT&amp;T's submarine systems and new media businesses are now included in &quot;discontinued operations,&quot;  and previously reported results have been restated to exclude these businesses from continuing operations.</p>
<p>With the September 30 spinoff of Lucent and the October 1 sale of AT&amp;T Capital complete, the third-quarter results released today are the last time these companies' results will be included in AT&amp;T's quarterly reporting.</p>
